// Snippet: Saliency
// Pattern: dockside chatter + a storyteller NPC who adapts to time of day
// Features: line groups (=>) with BestLeastRecentlyViewed saliency (ambient barks),
//            node groups with `when:` conditions (context-sensitive NPC behaviour)
// Run: cargo run -p bubbles-tui -- examples/snippets/saliency.bub
//
// Line groups: the => lines pick a different bark each visit, cycling through
// all options before repeating (BestLeastRecentlyViewed is the default strategy).
//
// Node groups: multiple nodes share the title "Storyteller". Bubbles selects the
// most appropriate one based on the `when:` condition. The $time_of_day variable
// controls which node fires; try changing its <<declare>> value and reloading (r).

title: Start
---
<<declare $time_of_day = "evening">>

=> Dockworker: Watch yer step on those wet planks!
=> Dockworker: Tide's coming in. Move them crates!
=> Dockworker: I've unloaded seventeen ships today. Seventeen!
=> Dockworker: Cap'n said we're done at sundown. Sundown was an hour ago.
=> Dockworker: Me back's killing me. Should've been a blacksmith.

-> Approach the storyteller.
    <<jump Storyteller>>
-> Listen to the dockworkers some more.
    <<jump Start>>
-> Leave the docks.
===

title: Storyteller
when: $time_of_day == "morning"
---
Storyteller: Ah, a fresh morning at the docks! Best time for a tale.
Storyteller: Did ye hear about the captain who sailed east to find the west?
Storyteller: Never came back. Presumably found it.
-> [Leave]
    <<jump Start>>
===

title: Storyteller
when: $time_of_day == "afternoon"
---
Storyteller: Afternoon on the docks. The heat makes the stories longer, I find.
Storyteller: There was a merchant who traded ice to a snow giant.
Storyteller: Clever man. Retired wealthy. The giant was less impressed.
-> [Leave]
    <<jump Start>>
===

title: Storyteller
when: $time_of_day == "evening"
---
Storyteller: Evening tide brings the best stories, they say.
Storyteller: A ghost ship drifted into this very harbour last Midsummer.
Storyteller: The crew played cards with the dockworkers all night.
Storyteller: Left owing twelve doubloons. Still hasn't paid up.
-> [Leave]
    <<jump Start>>
===

title: Storyteller
---
Storyteller: Hmm. Can't think of a story right now. Come back later.
-> [Leave]
    <<jump Start>>
===
